     1,
     "<div>\n<div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">Dear Altuna,</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    I recently used the methyKit package to analysis methylation data. I encountered some problems about Principal Component Anaysis. </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\">Fig A is the result using the methyKit package, </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\">Fig B is the cluster result using the prcomp package.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    </span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">  </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\"> </span><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/methylkit_discussion/attach/1554c6b155af/Catch497C(11-21-17-21-35).jpg?part=0.1\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%;min-height:auto!important;width:667px\"></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5\">     Two picture shows the two cluster results are different.  I have some problem about the results. 1) The value of  x  axis and y axis in the two picture are different. In the Fig B , x axis and y axis were  the PC1  and PC2 value respectively ,which were not scaled.  But the value of x axis and y axis  in the Fig A are greater than that in Fig B. Do you do some normalization? How to do it? 2) In the Fig A , we can identify the different cluster clearly, and not in Fig B.  MethyKit and I use the prcomp pakage, why are the cluster results different?</span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">     Look forward to your reply. Thank you very much!</span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    </span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    Best wishes,</span></div><div style=\"font-family:微软雅黑,Tahoma;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)\">    Yanling</span></div></div>\n<div><br></div><hr style=\"width:210px;min-height:1px\" color=\"#b5c4df\" size=\"1\" align=\"left\">\n<div><span><div style=\"MARGIN:10px;FONT-FAMILY:verdana;FONT-SIZE:10pt\"><div><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">we...@big.ac.cn</a></div></div></span></div>\n</div>"
